		{
			dependencies: ["05F98494C7647371"]
			description: [
				"This world is &chard&f, and it gets harder &oas you succeed&f. It moves through four stages, shared by everyone on the server:"
				""
				"&fNormal&f - from the start. Already nastier than vanilla."
				"&c&lExpert&f - the moment anyone first sets foot in the Nether, the End, the Aether or a Blue Skies realm."
				"&5&lMaster&f - the moment the Ender Dragon dies."
				"&6&lLegend&f - the moment the Dark Doppelganger dies."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Each stage makes monsters tougher (&c+50% health and +35% damage&f in Expert, &5+100% and +70%&f in Master, &6+150% and +100%&f in Legend), unlocks new enemies and tricks, and raises the rewards: more experience and a chance of doubled loot."
				""
				"There is no going back. Talk to your friends before somebody lights that portal."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "453621F5B9157CAE"
